From: Starch Linux Project
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional software page and final nonfatal job

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Starch-specific workflow]
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
---
diff --git a/src/modules/starchsoftware/CMakeLists.txt b/src/modules/starchsoftware/CMakeLists.txt
